            "doc_id": "overview",
            "line": 11,
            "text": "6. lab_backend_probe explicitly executes that expected_revision on cpu, mps or cuda. It verifies finite rewards, gradients, parameter updates and inference using synthetic tensors. robot_environment_steps is always 0."
          },
          {
            "doc_id": "scripts",
            "line": 11,
            "text": "- training_device: \"cpu\" | \"mps\" | \"cuda\""
          },
          {
            "doc_id": "scripts",
            "line": 12,
